<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP names new minerals group manager.</title>
<headline>BHP names new minerals group manager.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Tuesday it has named Len Dean group manager and senior vice president of marketing for its minerals division.</p>
<p>The position recently became vacant after James Rothwell to moved to the position of group general manager and president of BHP Diamonds Inc, BHP said.</p>
<p>Dean, 50, has held senior marketing positions in BHP's iron and coal divisions, BHP said.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 61-3 9286-1421</p>
</text>
